    "text": "## Poly V-belt drive\n\n<!-- Start of picture text -->\nDepending on the engine and the equipment Automatic Alternator\ntensioning roller pulley\ninstalled, there are three versions of the poly V-belt\ndrive.\nThey are generally driven by a six-rib poly V-belt. In\nall engines, the belt pulley on the crankshaft is\nequipped with a vibration damper to ensure the\nengine runs quietly.\nThe ancillaries are bolted directly onto the cylinder\nblock and the sump in order to save space.\nNo additional brackets are necessary.\nThe air conditioner compressor and the Poly V-belt\nalternator are driven electrically in the\n1.4 l 110 kW TSI engine in the Jetta\nCrankshaft pulley with\nHybrid. There is no poly V-belt drive. Air conditioner\nvibration damper\ncompressor\npulley\nVersions of the poly V-belt drive\nTensioning of the poly V-belt drive by ... 3-cylinder engine with 4-cylinder engine with\nintake manifold injection direct injection TSI\nMPI\nA flexible and tensile - without A/C compressor ----\npoly V-belt without tensioning roller - without BlueMotion\ntechnology\ns511_131\n- ----\nA rigid tensioning roller with A/C compressor\n- without BlueMotion\ntechnology\ns511_132\nAn automatic tensioning roller - with BlueMotion - with BlueMotion\ntechnology technology\n- -\nindependent of whether independent of whether\nan air conditioner an air conditioner\ncompressor is installed compressor is installed\ns511_133\n<!-- End of picture text -->\n\n12",
