    "text": "#### Toothed belt cover\n\nThe toothed belt is protected against the ingress of dust and dirt by a three-part toothed belt cover. This extends the service life of the toothed belt. \n\n\n\n<!-- Start of picture text -->\ndust and dirt by a three-part toothed belt cover. This Toothed belt tensioning roller\nextends the service life of the toothed belt. Plastic cover with\ninjection-moulded\nseal\nThe tensioning roller for the toothed belt can be\nreleased without having to remove the engine support.\nThe insert T10500 and the electronic torque wrench\nAluminium-silicon\nVAS 6583 will be required for this, among other tools. cover\nThe insert acts like an extension for a standard torque\nwrench. The tightening torque would normally be far\ntoo high on the bolted connection. To prevent this,\nactual dimensions are specified on the insert, which is Plastic cover with\ninjection-moulded seal\nentered into the electronic torque wrench. This input\nallows the bolt to the tightened to the correct torque.\ns511_104\nToothed belt\nThe toothed belt must not, under any circumstances,\nToothed belt with\nbe kinked when doing assembly work, when a coating made\nBacking material\ntransporting or storing it. Otherwise the tension to reduce wear\nmade of Teflon\nstrands will be damaged, the toothed belt will tear\nand engine damage will result.\nTension strands\nTooth fabric made of\npolyamide and Teflon\ns511_134\n<!-- End of picture text -->\n\n\n\n<!-- Start of picture text -->\ns511_134\n<!-- End of picture text -->\n\n60",
