    "text": "### **Audi valvelift system (AVS)**\n\nThe Audi valve lift system has been developed to optimize the change cycles of the dual fuel injection system.  AVS is used when changing between FSI and MPI operation of the engine. Initially it will only be installed on the exhaust camshaft of the 2.0L version of the EA888 3rd generation engine even though the dual injection system will not be utilized.",
