    "section_id": "auiliteraturtemplate_s0044",
    "page_start": 21,
    "page_end": 21,
    "text": "#### **Exhaust ports**\n\nThe exhaust ports are designed so that exhaust gases from one cylinder do not interfere with the purging process of other cylinders. \n\nThe full energy of the exhaust gas flow is available for driving the turbocharger. The exhaust ports of cylinders 1 and 4 as well as cylinders 2 and 3 converge at the transition to the turbocharger. \n\n\n\n<!-- Start of picture text -->\nIntegral exhaust manifold\nExhaust gas ports\nto the turbocharger\nmodule\n<!-- End of picture text -->\n\n606_007 \n\n21",
