    "text": "### **Coarse oil separation**\n\nThe coarse oil separator function is an integral part of the cylinder block. A portion of the oil is separated by changing the direction of oil flow in a labyrinth. \n\nThe separated oil returns to the oil pan via the return duct in the cylinder block. The end of the duct is below the oil level.",
