    "text": "## **Oil filler cap**\n\nA new style engine oil filler cap is installed on the camshaft chain cover.  It has been design to ease the opening and closing action and seal the engine bay from the environment in a safe, oil-tight manner. \n\nThe seal and bayonet lock of the new style cap are functionally separate.  The sealing face of the elastomer rectangular seal is smaller.  No relative movement occurs between the seal and the camshaft chain cover when it is installed. This minimizes the actuation forces.  The bayonet lock secures the cap by turning at 90 degree intervals. \n\n\n\n<!-- Start of picture text -->\nTop part of oil filler cap\nwith bayonet lock\nSpring\nBottom part of oil filler cap\nRectangular seal\n606_082\n<!-- End of picture text -->",
