    "text": "#### **Piston cooling jets deactivated**\n\nPiston Cooling Nozzle Control Module N522 is energized by the Engine Control Module. \n\nWhen energized, the control channel for the mechanical switching valve opens.  Pressurized oil acts directly on both sides of the piston of the mechanical switching valve. The spring displaces the valve and closes the passage to the oil gallery of the piston cooling jets. \n\n\n\n<!-- Start of picture text -->\nReduced Oil Pressure Switch\nF378\nOil filter\nmandrel\nOil gallery to the piston\ncooling jets closed\n606_004\nControl channel\nPiston Cooling Nozzle Control Mechanical switching valve,\nValve N522, energized shuts off the passage to the oil\ngallery of the piston cooling jets\n<!-- End of picture text -->",
