    "page_start": 60,
    "page_end": 60,
    "text": "#### **Warm-up / catalytic converter heating**\n\nWhen the engine is warm, optimal mixture homogenization is ensured by advance air-fuel mixing. There is therefore more time available for air-fuel mixture formation, resulting in fast, efficiency-optimized combustion. In addition, no power input is needed to drive the high pressure pump. \n\nDual direct injection is implemented during the intake and compression strokes. At the same time, the ignition timing is adjusted slightly retarded. The intake manifold flaps are closed.",
