    "text": "#### **Emergency running function**\n\nThe engine now switches to MPI mode. The intake manifold flaps are also closed at partial throttle, but not 1 : 1 in MPI mode (depending on the parameters in the engine map). \n\nIf either of these systems fails, the other system takes over the emergency running function. This ensures that the vehicle continues to be driveable. \n\n\n\nEngine Control Module J623 \n\n606_089 \n\nAnimation showing MPI and FSI operation. \n\n60\n\n**Notes** \n\n\n\n61",
