    "text": "## **Passive and active speed sensors**\n\nBoth types of sensor serve to inform the system of the vehicle speed and, much more importantly, the individual wheel speeds. The systems use differences in the wheel speeds to determine e.g. whether the tyres are located on a road surface with different levels of grip and there is therefore a risk of a critical vehicle dynamics situation occurring under braking.",
