    "text": "## **Brake systems with brake and/or engine intervention**\n\nIn the case of the following traction control systems, a critical driving situation is overcome either via the engine management system and/or by means of brake intervention via the hydraulic brake system. \n\n- Engine braking effect control **EBC** , \n\n- Engine intervention anti-lock brake system **E-ABS** and \n\n- Traction control system **TCS** . \n\n31",
