    "text": "# **Assist systems**\n\nAssist functions or systems have the task of supporting the driver in specific manoeuvres or driving situations. Ride comfort and vehicle safety are increased in this way. The systems do not usually intervene only in the event of critical situations, but are permanently active and can be deactivated if necessary.",
