    "text": "## **AUTO HOLD**\n\nAUTO HOLD supports drivers whose vehicles are fitted with an electromechanical parking brake instead of a mechanical hand brake. AUTO HOLD guarantees automatic and controlled holding of the vehicle when stationary, regardless of how the vehicle has come to a stop, and supports the driver on starting off (forwards or reverse travel). AUTO HOLD combines the following assist functions: \n\n\n\n\n\n<!-- Start of picture text -->\nS374_210\n<!-- End of picture text -->",
