    "text": "#### **Stop-and-go assist**\n\nWhen the vehicle is braked to a stop, the stop-and-go assist system automatically actuates the brakes. This offers additional driving comfort in stop-and-go traffic, as the driver no longer has to actuate the brake pedal to hold the stationary vehicle. \n\n\n\n_S374_214_",
