    "text": "#### **Hill start assist**\n\nAutomation of the holding and starting off process supports starting off on gradients. On starting off, the brake is released at the right point in time by the hill start assist system. Undesired rolling backwards is avoided. \n\n\n\n\n\n<!-- Start of picture text -->\nS374_212\n<!-- End of picture text -->",
