    "text": "#### **Automatic parking**\n\nIf the vehicle is stopped with the AUTO HOLD function activated and the driver door or the driver's seat belt buckle is then opened or the ignition is switched off, the parking brake is automatically activated. \n\nAUTO HOLD is also a pure extension of the ESP regulation system's software, and requires the vehicle to be equipped with ESP and an electromechanical parking brake. \n\n69",
