    "text": "### What is heat?\n\nHeat (mathematical symbol Q, unit joule) is a form of energy that is transferred between two systems due to temperature differences. \n\nHeat always flows from a body with high temperature to a body with low temperature. \n\nHeat can be transferred by means of thermal conduction, thermal radiation or convection. \n\n\n\n\n\n<!-- Start of picture text -->\ns532_002\n<!-- End of picture text -->",
