    "text": "### Heat condenser function\n\nCondensation refers to the transition from a gaseous to a liquid state. \n\nThe hot, gaseous refrigerant reaches the condenser. The condenser pipes and fins absorb heat. Cool outside air flows through the condenser. It absorbs heat and is guided into the vehicle interior. At the same time, the refrigerant gas in the condenser cools down, condenses and becomes a liquid. \n\n13\n\nComponents",
