    "page_end": 14,
    "text": "### Evaporator function\n\n<!-- Start of picture text -->\ns532_025\nThe evaporator works as a condenser during heat\npump operation (“heating” function). This means that\nThe evaporator works as an evaporator in\nthe air flowing through the evaporator is heated.\n“cooling” mode (function). This means that\nthe air flowing through the evaporator is\ncooled.\nExpansion valves and shut-off valves\nFitting locations of expansion\nvalves/shut-off valves\nThree expansion valves and three shut-off valves are\ninstalled in the heat pump circuit:\nN642\n• N636 Refrigerant expansion valve 1 (EV1) N643\n• N637 Refrigerant expansion valve 2 (EV2)\n• N638 Refrigerant expansion valve 3 (EV1) N696\n• N696 Refrigerant shut-off valve 1 (AV1) N636\n• N642 Refrigerant shut-off valve 4 (AV4)\n• N643 Refrigerant shut-off valve 5 (AV5)\nN637\nN638\n<!-- End of picture text -->\n\n\n\n<!-- Start of picture text -->\ns532_028\n<!-- End of picture text -->\n\n14",
