    "text": "### Description\n\nDue to the high level of network functions, a great deal of data is transferred. To assure the effective exchange of data, several data bus systems are necessary that transfer data between each other. \n\nThe data bus diagnosis interface connects these data buses together as a gateway interface and makes data transfer possible. This function that \n\n\n\nwas perviously integrated in the dash panel insert or onboard power supply control unit, is now an independent control unit.",
