    "text": "### Exchanging the engine control unit\n\nThe engine control unit is enabled in the same way as the third generation immobiliser. Two of the three adapted components (key and dash panel insert) must remain in the vehicle. \n\nFor adaption of a new control unit, this can be done without a personal identification number. \n\n\n\nFor adaption of a control unit that was previously installed in a different vehicle, a personal identification number is required. \n\n52",
