    "text": "### Technical datasheet\n\n|Manufacturer|AISIN AW Co. LTD.<br>Japan|\n|---|---|\n|Production designation|AQ300|\n|Service designation|09S|\n|ATF specification|Refer to ETKA catalog|\n|Fillingcapacity|Refer to ELSA manual|\n|Service period|Not yet planned|\n\n\n\n\n\nS588_028 \n\n\n\nThe 8-speed automatic gearbox 09S from the Japanese Transmission Group AISIN AW CO LTD is a more developed version of 8-speed automatic gearbox 09P, which is currently mounted on Tiguan LWB. \n\nThe eight forward gears work by means of a system of modified planetary assemblies. Automatic transmission 09S is designed for the StartStop function by means of a new electro-valve that keeps the first-gear clutch engaged while the function is on, ensuring a smooth connection when the idling motor starts up.",
