    "text": "### Overview of the data bus systems used\n\nAll CAN bus systems in the New Jetta have a transfer speed of 500 kBit/s. \n\nThe LIN data buses have a transfer rate of 19.2kBit/s and the MOST150 data bus using fiber-optic technology has a transfer rate of 150 kbit/s. \n\nThe data bus diagnostic interface J533 contains the control system for several LIN buses and forms the link between the individual CAN bus systems as usual. Further LIN buses are connected to various control units. \n\n\n\n\n\nS588_062 \n\nKey \n\nJ533      Data bus on-board diagnostic interface CAN data bus cable LIN data bus cable \n\n53\n\nElectrical system",
