    "text": "## Telephone interfaces\n\nIn some markets, the “Comfort” telephone interface option with an inductive charging function (Wireless-Charging WLC) will be available. \n\nIn this interface, the mobile phone is linked by induction with the R65 telephone antenna integrated in the ceiling. This ensures that there is always the best possible telephone reception in the vehicle. The new R65 phone antenna is compatible with the LTE mobile phone standard.",
