    "text": "## Modular Infotainment System (MIB)\n\nThe following Infotainment (MIB) Modules Generation 2 are installed in the New Jetta. Starting with the Composition Media model, the J794 external infotainment unit is mounted in the dash panel glove compartment. \n\nThe following table shows a functional comparison of the 3 available radio versions. \n\n\n\n|Function|Composition Color|Composition Media|Discover Media|\n|---|---|---|---|\n||PR.Nr.: I8C|PR.Nr.: I8F|PR.Nr.: I8F+7UF|\n|Screen 6.5” 8” 8”|6,5”|8”|8”|\n|Touch screen|•|•|•|\n|Radio frequencies|AM/FM|AM/FM|AM/FM|\n|RDS|•|•|•|\n|DAB|-|○|○|\n|Station logos|-|•|•|\n|Diversity system|•|•|•|\n|CD player|○|•|•|\n|USB type-A connector (com-<br>patible with Apple)|○|•|•|\n|SD card reader|•|•|• (double)|\n|AUX-IN interface|-|-|-|\n|Volume output adjustment|3 areas|5 areas|5 areas|\n|Outputpower|4x20 Watt|4x20 Watt|4x20 Watt|\n|Voice control|-|○|○|\n|Front speakers|•|•|•|\n|Rear speakers|○|•|•|\n|Compatibility with reversing<br>camera|-|○|○|\n|Basic Bluetooth interface|•|•|•|\n|“Comfort” Mobile Interface|○|○|○|\n|\"BeatsAudio\" Soundsystem|-|○|○|\n|MP3, WMA|•|•|•|\n|AAC, FLAC, OGG, WAV|-|•|•|\n|Navigation|-|-|•|\n|App-Connect|○|○|○|\n\n\n\n• Standard function ○ Optional equipment  - Not available \n\n62",
