    "text": "Car-Net \n\nThe following Car-Net services are available for the New Jetta: \n\nGuide & Info \n\nApp-Connect \n\nSecurity & service \n\n\n\nThe online applications and functions depend on country and equipment. Not every service will be available when the New Jetta is launched. \n\nCar-Net functions that will be available in your market can be referred to in the following page of information: www.volkswagen-carnet.com",
