    "text": "### Fault indication by self-diagnosis fault warning lamp K83 (MIL)\n\nIf misfiring, which can damage the catalytic converter, occurs, the self-diagnosis fault warning lamp (MIL) must indicate this immediately by flashing. The vehicle can then only be operated at a reduced power output. The self-diagnosis fault warning lamp (MIL) switches to steady light.",
