    "text": "#### Was does OBD II test?\n\nAn aged or faulty catalytic converter has less oxygen absorption capacity. Therefore its conversion capability is impaired. If the valid limit values for the concentration of hydrocarbons in the exhaust gas during of a mandatory emissions test are exceeded by a factor of 1.5, this must be detected on-line.",
