    "text": "#### <mark>Electrical circuit</mark>\n\nIf the control unit pulse signal fails, the combination valve can no longer open. The secondary air pump cannot inject any air. \n\n\n\n<!-- Start of picture text -->\ntion valve can no longer open. The secondary air\npump cannot inject any air.\nN112\n+ 175_072\nSecondary air pump relay J299\nis activated by the Motronic control unit to switch Electrical circuit\nthe secondary air pump motor.\n+ V101 175_074\n175_073\nSecondary air pump motor V101\nis activated via a relay.\nThe secondary air pump motor delivers the air mass flow for the secondary air system.\n<!-- End of picture text -->\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<!-- Start of picture text -->\nV101\n175_075\n<!-- End of picture text -->\n\n\n\n<!-- Start of picture text -->\n175_076\n<!-- End of picture text -->\n\n34\n\n<!-- Start of picture text -->\nThe tank ventilation system\n175_077\n<!-- End of picture text -->",
